request. 5. Start the simulation or packet capture. 6. Select an
application-layer packet from the event list or captured packets. 7.
Inspect its protocol, source and destination addresses, and port
numbers. 8. Open packet details and examine the information at each
protocol layer. 9. Compare request and response packets.

